<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Idaho Housing at 1545 EDT.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Idaho Housing at 1545 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>IDAHO HOUSING AND FINANCE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE BONDS, 1997 SERIES E</p>
